## Phase 1.1: OpenGL driver bootstrap
Docs: [Driver Backends](../planning/subsystems/driver-backends.md), [Diagnostics and Tooling](../planning/subsystems/diagnostics-and-tooling.md)
- [ ] Initialize the OpenGL driver with capability reporting.
- [ ] Provide graphics and async-compute contexts (mapped to one context where needed).
- [ ] Define per-thread context acquisition and pooling policy (single-threaded now, scalable later).
- [ ] Implement debug marker integration and validation hooks.

## Phase 1.2: Command submission path
Docs: [Command Model](../planning/subsystems/command-model.md)
- [ ] Implement command execution through `IRHICommandContext`.
- [ ] Implement command list submission with fence signaling.
- [ ] Integrate a minimal frame loop and frame counter updates.
- [ ] Reset/recycle command allocators on fence completion.
- [ ] Define an immediate execution wrapper that funnels through the same command path.

## Phase 1.3: Shader compilation path (minimal)
Docs: [Shader System](../planning/subsystems/shader-system.md)
- [ ] Integrate DXC for HLSL to SPIR-V compilation.
- [ ] Wire the Tiny* preprocessing and AST pipeline for shader inputs.
- [ ] Build a minimal reflection pass for vertex/pixel inputs and required bindings.
- [ ] Run SPIR-V reflection and minimal optimization before caching.
- [ ] Cache compiled shaders by backend and hash.

## Phase 1.4: Buffers and uploads
Docs: [Resource System](../planning/subsystems/resource-system.md), [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md), [Command Model](../planning/subsystems/command-model.md)
- [ ] Implement vertex buffer creation and staging uploads.
- [ ] Implement dynamic ring-buffer updates for per-frame data.
- [ ] Tag intended buffer access states for draw submissions (full validation in Phase 4).
- [ ] Define a unified copy/transfer command surface (buffer copy, texture copy, blit, resolve).
- [ ] Implement buffer copy commands for staging and device-local transfers.

## Phase 1.5: Minimal PSO and draw
Docs: [Pipeline State](../planning/subsystems/pipeline-state.md), [Descriptors and Binding](../planning/subsystems/descriptors-and-binding.md)
- [ ] Create a minimal graphics PSO (shaders + raster/depth/blend defaults).
- [ ] Create a minimal binding layout object from reflection.
- [ ] Bind a minimal descriptor table for per-draw data.
- [ ] Issue a draw call and render a triangle through the RHI.
